=-2\\iff \\frac{a+2}{3}=-1\\iff a+2=-3\\iff a=-5\"></span>. </p></center>", "title": "Решение", "asset_keys": []}, "operation": "rewrite", "transformation_target_id": "section:solution:1"}, {"at": "2026-10-02T17:01:58.193233+00:00", "by": {"type": "pipeline", "stage": "deterministic_svg"}, "operation": "remove", "transformation_target_id": "asset:formula_1"}, {"at": "2026-10-02T17:01:58.193233+00:00", "by": {"type": "pipeline", "stage": "deterministic_svg"}, "operation": "remove", "transformation_target_id": "asset:formula_2"}, {"at": "2026-10-02T17:01:58.193233+00:00", "by": {"type": "pipeline", "stage": "deterministic_svg"}, "operation": "remove", "transformation_target_id": "asset:formula_3"}, {"at": "2026-10-02T17:01:58.193233+00:00", "by": {"type": "pipeline", "stage": "deterministic_svg"}, "operation": "remove", "transformation_target_id": "asset:formula_4"}, {"at": "2026-10-02T17:01:58.193233+00:00", "by": {"type": "pipeline", "stage": "deterministic_svg"}, "operation": "remove", "transformation_target_id": "asset:formula_5"}, {"at": "2026-10-02T17:01:58.193233+00:00", "by": {"type": "pipeline", "stage": "deterministic_svg"}, "operation": "remove", "transformation_target_id": "asset:formula_6"}, {"at": "2026-10-02T17:01:58.193233+00:00", "by": {"type": "pipeline", "stage": "deterministic_svg"}, "operation": "remove", "transformation_target_id": "asset:formula_7"}, {"at": "2026-10-02T17:01:58.193233+00:00", "by": {"type": "pipeline", "stage": "deterministic_svg"}, "operation": "remove", "transformation_target_id": "asset:formula_8"}]}, "normalized_content": {"assets": [{"alt": "", "url": "/assets/cf9395f9-176f-498c-8eef-8eb148cd6138", "kind": "ordinary_image", "asset_id": "cf9395f9-176f-498c-8eef-8eb148cd6138", "asset_key": "image_1", "transformation_target_id": "asset:image_1"}], "format": "teacherhelper-normalized", "sections": [{"key": "condition", "html": "<p><img alt=\"\" data-asset-id=\"cf9395f9-176f-498c-8eef-8eb148cd6138\" data-asset-key=\"image_1\" da